Tarang — Alembic Migrations
============================

This directory contains Alembic migration scripts for the Tarang database.

Key Commands:
  alembic upgrade head      — Apply all pending migrations
  alembic downgrade -1      — Rollback the last migration
  alembic downgrade base    — Rollback ALL migrations
  alembic current           — Show current migration version
  alembic history           — Show migration history
  alembic revision -m "msg" — Create a new empty migration

Flow:
  1. Edit ORM models in app/models/
  2. Run: alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"
  3. Review the generated migration in alembic/versions/
  4. Run: alembic upgrade head

Directory structure:
  alembic.ini          — Top-level config (in api/ root)
  alembic/env.py       — Runtime config (DB connection, async setup)
  alembic/versions/    — Migration scripts (tracked by git)
